WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:04.300
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:04.430 --> 00:07.460
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:07.970 --> 00:10.710
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.710 --> 00:15.340
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.780 --> 00:22.740
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:24.490 --> 00:27.360
Dragon Drive

00:27.360 --> 00:32.850
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:32.990 --> 00:35.960
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:35.960 --> 00:39.200
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.700 --> 00:44.070
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:44.070 --> 00:46.040
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.040 --> 00:52.340
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:54.080 --> 00:56.450
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:56.450 --> 00:59.650
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

00:59.990 --> 01:04.990
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:04.990 --> 01:06.550
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.690 --> 01:09.100
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:09.100 --> 01:12.230
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.630 --> 01:17.710
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.710 --> 01:20.440
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.440 --> 01:28.540
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:40.630 --> 01:42.290
Give back the Dragonite!

01:42.560 --> 01:44.900
You're a real pain, you little brat!

01:46.770 --> 01:48.130
Give it back...

01:50.270 --> 01:51.740
Hand over the Dragonite!

01:51.840 --> 01:53.540
D-Dad?!

01:54.010 --> 01:55.570
You've come for me, Father!

01:55.680 --> 01:58.410
He doesn't really have any children.

01:58.650 --> 02:02.550
You're a computer program
created to keep an eye on me.

02:02.850 --> 02:04.580
You're not even human!

02:05.420 --> 02:06.280
Father...

02:06.620 --> 02:07.950
I'm deleting you.

02:10.590 --> 02:12.790
No! I don't want to disappear!

02:15.130 --> 02:17.360
This is the strongest power-up I've ever had!

02:20.100 --> 02:22.870
The final stage begins at last!

02:24.610 --> 02:27.910
The Return

02:39.490 --> 02:41.250
Jigen Joker has awakened!

02:41.690 --> 02:42.950
Which means...

02:43.190 --> 02:45.590
...we can return to Earth!

02:45.730 --> 02:47.920
What are you waiting for, Reiji?!

02:48.500 --> 02:51.060
What are we just standing around for?
Let's get home fast!

02:51.430 --> 02:53.160
Well, it's just...

02:53.230 --> 02:54.200
Reiji!

02:54.340 --> 02:55.500
Reiji!

02:55.940 --> 02:58.770
Why do you hesitate? Are you afraid?

02:59.840 --> 03:00.810
Hikaru.

03:01.280 --> 03:04.370
Whoever the enemy, all we have to do
is crush them.

03:04.880 --> 03:06.180
Am I wrong?

03:09.720 --> 03:11.120
Let's go!

03:11.190 --> 03:13.480
We'll go back to Earth and seal away Shinryu.

03:13.690 --> 03:15.620
Sh-Shinryu?

03:16.060 --> 03:19.190
Shinryu influences all dragons.

03:19.990 --> 03:22.520
The fact that Jigen Joker has awoken...

03:23.000 --> 03:26.490
...means that the seal has been broken,
and Shinryu has also awoken!

03:28.000 --> 03:29.830
I-I see.

03:30.440 --> 03:32.530
So Shinryu has awoken.

03:33.440 --> 03:35.410
Yeah. But...

03:35.510 --> 03:37.030
We will never give up!

03:37.680 --> 03:39.110
Right, Reiji?

03:39.810 --> 03:40.780
Yeah!

03:42.120 --> 03:43.080
Reiji...

03:45.850 --> 03:47.880
Don't worry.

03:48.090 --> 03:51.220
We'll protect both Earth and Rikyu,
no matter what.

04:02.070 --> 04:04.040
You haven't forgotten your promise, I hope.

04:04.740 --> 04:05.710
Huh?

04:06.040 --> 04:07.940
That if we return to Earth safely...

04:08.410 --> 04:10.540
...you'll start dating me.

04:11.250 --> 04:12.300
Did you forget?

04:12.410 --> 04:14.850
Huh? Did I say that?

04:23.120 --> 04:24.590
What's wrong?

04:24.660 --> 04:26.590
It's Jigen Joker.

04:26.660 --> 04:31.760
If I don't control it carefully,
I won't be able to get everyone to earth.

04:32.730 --> 04:34.600
I think it'll be okay.

04:34.670 --> 04:36.100
You can do it.

04:37.010 --> 04:39.700
L is waiting for your return.

04:40.980 --> 04:42.940
L? My sister?

04:43.340 --> 04:45.210
That's why you can do it.

04:54.220 --> 04:55.780
This is Shinryu?

04:55.860 --> 04:58.520
Doesn't look powerful
enough to be the last item.

05:22.080 --> 05:24.480
Have you finished, Kouhei?

05:24.850 --> 05:25.820
Huh?

05:26.590 --> 05:28.320
You've had your fun.

05:28.760 --> 05:30.160
Now leave D-Z one.

05:31.260 --> 05:33.320
You act like a father...

05:33.390 --> 05:36.360
...when you're really just
using me like a slave.

05:36.860 --> 05:40.320
And now you plan to take away
the best item I've earned?

05:40.470 --> 05:41.770
Well, it's not gonna be so easy.

05:42.640 --> 05:44.540
This guy belongs to me!

05:44.910 --> 05:46.170
It won't work.

05:46.240 --> 05:48.210
You lack the abilities to control it.

05:50.140 --> 05:51.410
What do you know?

05:52.110 --> 05:56.280
I'm sick and tired
of taking orders from you.

05:56.920 --> 05:57.890
Kouhei.

05:58.050 --> 05:59.020
Shut up.

05:59.520 --> 06:02.350
All you've done is sit back like a big shot
and watch as others do the work.

06:02.560 --> 06:05.860
You have no right to just show up
and claim the prize!

06:07.760 --> 06:09.350
Just watch.

06:09.560 --> 06:11.960
I'll make it an exciting ending!

06:19.010 --> 06:20.970
We're counting on you, guardian deity.

06:25.210 --> 06:26.700
What is it, Chibi?!

06:26.910 --> 06:30.710
Senkohcoola is sensing his duty
as a guardian deity.

06:30.790 --> 06:32.250
Duty?

06:33.090 --> 06:37.220
Senkohcoola and Shinryu
can be thought of as light and darkness.

06:43.230 --> 06:45.560
When darkness attempted
to engulf the world...

06:46.170 --> 06:51.070
...the guardian deity Senkohcoola
became light to save the world.

06:56.280 --> 06:57.570
And that'll happen again.

06:59.580 --> 07:01.740
- We can win, can't we?
- That is unknown.

07:02.380 --> 07:04.680
But we've also got
the powers of SinnSaber.

07:04.850 --> 07:06.110
I'm sure we'll win.

07:06.520 --> 07:09.980
Should all the hidden power
sleeping within Senkohcoola awaken...

07:10.090 --> 07:11.850
...then Shinryu can be sealed away.

07:13.730 --> 07:16.250
We'll finish everything with this battle.

07:17.060 --> 07:19.090
I promise that Shinryu will be sealed away.

07:19.730 --> 07:20.790
Right, Chibi?

07:23.470 --> 07:24.940
What is it, Elder?

07:25.910 --> 07:27.310
Can you really do it?

07:29.310 --> 07:31.780
In order to seal Shinryu...

07:32.110 --> 07:36.780
...you must use all of Senkohcoola's
powers without hesitation.

07:38.450 --> 07:43.050
And once all of Senkohcoola's
powers have been used up...

07:43.290 --> 07:45.820
...it will once again fall into a deep sleep.

07:46.830 --> 07:48.460
You understand that, don't you?

07:48.560 --> 07:49.530
Yeah.

07:49.900 --> 07:52.960
Thank you for worrying about me, Elder.

07:53.970 --> 07:55.060
Reiji.

07:59.010 --> 08:00.200
Elder.

08:00.780 --> 08:01.870
Meguru.

08:02.710 --> 08:04.910
Thank you for everything up until now.

08:14.060 --> 08:15.550
Goodbye, Elder.

08:16.320 --> 08:18.820
I would've liked to teach
you everything so that...

08:18.890 --> 08:22.560
...you could one day take my place but...

08:24.130 --> 08:25.560
Take care of yourself.

08:26.800 --> 08:27.770
Right.

08:33.370 --> 08:37.780
- Let's go, everyone!
- Hey, wait for me, My Sweet Honey!

08:46.850 --> 08:48.450
Please, Jigen Joker.

08:48.690 --> 08:52.520
Use your powers now
to guide us back to Earth.

08:52.790 --> 08:53.760
Please!

09:01.670 --> 09:03.140
Let's go, Reiji!

09:03.400 --> 09:05.600
Yeah! Let's go, Chibi.

09:23.760 --> 09:27.490
Do your best, Reiji. All of you.

09:32.530 --> 09:33.500
Here I come, Dad!

09:37.610 --> 09:40.070
Show him your powers, Shinryu!

09:43.880 --> 09:46.900
What's wrong, Kouhei?
Try and control Shinryu.

09:47.280 --> 09:49.910
Blast you! Move, will ya?!

09:50.620 --> 09:52.750
You freed Shinryu...

09:53.290 --> 09:55.410
...but that's all you did.

09:55.720 --> 09:58.090
You have not awakened Shinryu.

09:58.930 --> 10:00.890
Wh-What?

10:01.400 --> 10:04.060
Shinryu, sealed for what
seemed like an eternity...

10:04.130 --> 10:05.930
...has yet to awaken.

10:06.270 --> 10:07.960
Don't you realize that?

10:08.340 --> 10:10.770
And yet you think you can control Shinryu?

10:10.840 --> 10:12.030
Don't make me laugh.

10:12.740 --> 10:13.730
You...

10:14.210 --> 10:16.610
Now you will learn the
price of such foolishness!

10:26.990 --> 10:28.110
That dragon...

10:28.790 --> 10:31.280
It's not weakening, the
power level is increasing.

10:31.660 --> 10:33.130
At this rate...

10:37.770 --> 10:39.560
You're powerless, Kouhei.

10:39.830 --> 10:43.360
You and Shinryu shall both
fall to your knees before me.

10:44.110 --> 10:46.600
Th-There's no way I'm gonna
hand it over to you.

10:47.010 --> 10:49.070
Do you still not understand, Kouhei?

10:49.480 --> 10:52.470
Why I brought Shinryu into D-Z one?

10:52.750 --> 10:53.710
Wh-What?

10:54.280 --> 10:56.220
When I first learned
of the incredible powers of Shinryu...

10:56.280 --> 10:57.980
...I wanted those powers for myself.

10:58.320 --> 11:00.290
Just like you do.

11:01.190 --> 11:04.650
But one cannot call Shinryu his own
unless he can successfully control it.

11:06.960 --> 11:11.360
I made D-Z one so that I could
suppress Shinryu's immense powers...

11:11.430 --> 11:13.330
...and control it at will.

11:14.140 --> 11:17.160
D-Z one is a dimension made for Shinryu!

11:19.270 --> 11:21.330
D-Z one is my world!

11:21.780 --> 11:23.840
In D-Z one, I am God!

11:27.820 --> 11:28.780
Get real!

11:29.180 --> 11:31.340
You're not going to have everything your way!

11:36.460 --> 11:39.690
I shall at least praise you
for successfully bringing back Shinryu.

11:39.860 --> 11:41.790
I will therefore let you live.

11:44.600 --> 11:47.090
H-How kind of you.

11:47.540 --> 11:49.830
I'm so glad to be your son.

11:50.540 --> 11:51.400
Disappear!

11:52.070 --> 11:53.870
Think you can make me?

11:53.940 --> 11:57.270
I'm not as easy to get rid of as Hideaki.

12:07.620 --> 12:09.590
Treating me like a fool!

12:09.660 --> 12:13.060
I'll crush your "ending"!

12:14.100 --> 12:15.720
Idiotic father and son.

12:15.830 --> 12:17.630
They've finally started a real battle.

12:18.770 --> 12:19.730
Well?

12:19.830 --> 12:22.670
Do you think we can
regain control of D-Z one?

12:22.740 --> 12:23.930
I'll do it!

12:24.000 --> 12:26.730
I'm not letting guys like that
control D-Z one!

12:29.210 --> 12:30.070
Blast it.

12:30.140 --> 12:34.080
Saizou Toki has posted blocks,
protecting every part of the system.

12:34.180 --> 12:35.670
Can't we do anything?

12:35.820 --> 12:37.780
Is all we can do watch?

12:38.550 --> 12:40.080
There has to be some way.

12:41.390 --> 12:42.750
Some way.

12:56.570 --> 12:57.730
You're not bad.

12:57.970 --> 12:59.100
You're in my way!

13:13.690 --> 13:14.950
Blast it!

13:19.590 --> 13:24.390
You can watch your so-called "ending"
from where you are.

13:25.600 --> 13:27.000
Don't be so sure.

13:27.370 --> 13:30.740
I should've spent more time teaching you
manners.

13:40.410 --> 13:42.410
What are you looking at?

13:49.120 --> 13:50.490
I see.

13:50.560 --> 13:52.420
So that's how it is.

13:52.690 --> 13:54.990
You need my help.

13:55.500 --> 13:59.730
Why didn't you tell me sooner
instead of snoozing?

14:00.670 --> 14:02.830
I-I give up, Dad.

14:03.200 --> 14:05.500
H-Help me.

14:08.610 --> 14:09.840
Fooled ya!

14:13.850 --> 14:15.040
Now, do it!

14:15.650 --> 14:18.140
You need me, right? Shinryu!

14:21.290 --> 14:22.350
You fool.

14:34.840 --> 14:37.700
The true awakening is near.

14:40.340 --> 14:42.500
That voice just now... was it Kouhei?

14:43.540 --> 14:44.740
Wait, Mahiru!

14:48.350 --> 14:50.280
So you're the ones who came from Rikyu.

14:50.450 --> 14:53.220
Blast that Kouhei,
bringing back interlopers!

14:53.950 --> 14:55.080
Where is Kouhei?!

14:56.390 --> 14:57.690
- He's gone.
- What?!

14:58.130 --> 14:59.350
I'll let you see him.

14:59.430 --> 15:00.890
You can follow him!

15:02.560 --> 15:03.530
Mahiru!

15:10.100 --> 15:12.660
Mahiru! I'll take care of this.

15:12.870 --> 15:13.900
You get out of here!

15:13.970 --> 15:15.070
Don't be stupid!

15:15.140 --> 15:17.370
No way am I gonna let you save my life!

15:17.650 --> 15:19.880
At this rate, we'll both die!

15:20.310 --> 15:21.840
Don't write me off so easily.

15:21.920 --> 15:23.750
I'm not gonna die in a place like this!

15:24.620 --> 15:26.810
I'm not about to die in a place like this!

15:27.320 --> 15:29.850
Exactly. You are going to survive.

15:30.790 --> 15:31.620
Yakou...

15:31.860 --> 15:34.090
- What?!
- N-Nothing.

15:34.730 --> 15:35.700
Yakou.

15:36.060 --> 15:39.460
I finally understand how you felt.

15:39.670 --> 15:41.430
I will save Mahiru.

15:41.600 --> 15:43.590
And with that, I will be victorious.

15:47.540 --> 15:48.510
Mahiru!

15:48.610 --> 15:51.130
He's not an opponent that you can beat
by recklessly charging at him.

15:51.280 --> 15:52.580
You've gotta wait for the right chance!

15:53.550 --> 15:57.280
Who would have guessed that there'd be
people from Rikyu who have brains.

15:59.520 --> 16:00.950
I won't kill you right away.

16:01.260 --> 16:03.620
You made the long journey
from Rikyu, after all.

16:03.690 --> 16:06.350
You shall have the privilege of witnessing
Shinryu's resurrection with your own eyes.

16:06.430 --> 16:08.160
That's not gonna happen!

16:16.900 --> 16:17.960
They've come home.

16:18.510 --> 16:21.470
No, I guess I should say
they've come back to save us all.

16:27.510 --> 16:28.480
Meguru.

16:29.020 --> 16:30.640
The players have returned.

16:31.150 --> 16:32.980
We've got to do our part as well.

16:36.390 --> 16:38.090
You're not getting away with this!

16:38.160 --> 16:40.720
Shinryu is one of Rikyu's dragons.

16:40.890 --> 16:42.330
I'll have you return it.

16:42.860 --> 16:44.260
Are you all right, Rockaku?

16:44.330 --> 16:45.420
Still alive?

16:45.670 --> 16:47.130
You guys are late!

16:47.200 --> 16:48.290
How mean.

16:48.670 --> 16:50.970
We came as fast as we could, you know.

16:54.380 --> 16:55.870
Let's finish this!

16:56.110 --> 16:57.010
I agree.

16:57.080 --> 16:59.100
Children should stay out of this.

16:59.250 --> 17:00.340
Who is he?

17:00.750 --> 17:03.340
Saizou Toki. RI-ON's leader!

17:05.820 --> 17:07.880
Well, well. I see that you've come back.

17:08.060 --> 17:09.450
I won't run anymore.

17:09.520 --> 17:11.820
I won't let you make your ambition a reality.

17:11.990 --> 17:14.290
It's not an ambition. It's an ideal.

17:15.000 --> 17:18.990
I shall create an ideal world
using the powers of Shinryu!

17:19.100 --> 17:20.120
Shut up!

17:20.200 --> 17:22.930
You're trying to use Shinryu
to destroy this world!

17:23.000 --> 17:24.270
Don't talk like you know best!

17:24.510 --> 17:25.530
Destroy?

17:25.870 --> 17:27.360
That's the problem with children like you.

17:27.540 --> 17:29.030
You don't understand anything.

17:29.540 --> 17:32.210
Stop dismissing us as children!

17:32.480 --> 17:35.000
Shinryu's powers shouldn't be used!

17:35.350 --> 17:36.410
Why not?

17:36.480 --> 17:37.880
Why shouldn't we use its powers?

17:38.050 --> 17:39.710
W-Well...

17:40.090 --> 17:42.060
Because it would destroy the world.

17:42.820 --> 17:44.760
So it's okay as long as the world
isn't destroyed?

17:44.830 --> 17:47.320
Huh? Can you do that?

17:48.430 --> 17:49.560
D-Don't ask me!

17:50.230 --> 17:52.720
There's no reason to fear
great power.

17:53.270 --> 17:55.430
It just needs to be managed and controlled.

17:55.840 --> 17:57.390
I don't think that's possible.

17:57.640 --> 17:58.940
But I can do it.

17:59.540 --> 18:02.070
How do you intend to use those powers?

18:03.080 --> 18:05.050
What do you plan on doing...

18:05.450 --> 18:07.440
...once you have the power
to destroy the world?

18:08.720 --> 18:10.620
I'll begin a new era.

18:17.660 --> 18:19.420
Humans are foolish creatures.

18:19.690 --> 18:23.560
They only see what's directly in front of them.

18:24.600 --> 18:26.530
Earth is slowly disintegrating...

18:26.600 --> 18:28.590
...yet no one is doing anything about it.

18:34.270 --> 18:37.970
Is it right to proceed on this path
of destruction without taking action?

18:39.050 --> 18:42.410
I wish to save this world,
by my own hand.

18:43.020 --> 18:45.310
He may not be such a bad guy, after all.

18:45.450 --> 18:47.180
Don't be so gullible!

18:48.060 --> 18:51.250
If what you say is true,
you shouldn't need Shinryu!

18:51.630 --> 18:53.460
I need power.

18:53.960 --> 18:57.490
An absolute power strong enough
to prevent anyone from opposing me!

18:57.560 --> 18:58.550
That's wrong!

18:58.730 --> 18:59.720
You're mistaken!

19:00.830 --> 19:02.500
You still fail to understand.

19:02.770 --> 19:04.240
You really are children.

19:04.840 --> 19:06.640
The people need a leader!

19:07.470 --> 19:09.240
The only way Earth is going to survive...

19:09.310 --> 19:11.570
...is by having one powerful man
control everything.

19:11.810 --> 19:13.970
It's for the sake of building an ideal future!

19:14.180 --> 19:16.380
In other words, you want to rule the world.

19:18.020 --> 19:19.950
Looks like the truth is finally out.

19:20.090 --> 19:22.920
If you try to control people by force,
no one will follow you!

19:23.590 --> 19:25.820
We won't let you have Shinryu!

19:26.090 --> 19:29.760
Nobody should have
enough power to destroy the world!

19:30.830 --> 19:32.820
And can you lot do anything about it?

19:33.230 --> 19:34.260
We'll give it our best shot!

19:37.040 --> 19:38.000
Shinryu.

19:39.470 --> 19:41.070
It looks like it's sleeping.

19:41.880 --> 19:45.500
Right now, we can seal it away
without using all of Chibi's powers.

19:46.210 --> 19:48.240
Chibi. We're gonna defeat Shinryu!

19:48.750 --> 19:51.340
SinnSaber!

20:00.730 --> 20:02.920
We'll put an end to this right now, Chibi!

20:09.670 --> 20:11.540
Where do you think this is?

20:11.940 --> 20:13.930
The world of D-Z one belongs to me!

20:14.470 --> 20:15.870
This is not Rikyu!

20:18.350 --> 20:19.610
O-Oh, no!

20:19.680 --> 20:22.050
He's started to take control of D-Z one!

20:26.320 --> 20:27.720
Blast it!

20:30.020 --> 20:31.320
Idiots.

20:31.390 --> 20:33.020
You guys can't do it.

20:37.560 --> 20:38.900
Disappear.

21:08.700 --> 21:10.360
What's with this thing?!

21:32.050 --> 21:33.520
Where am I?

21:35.520 --> 21:37.290
This is my room.

21:38.760 --> 21:40.750
Was it a dream?

21:56.580 --> 21:59.240
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:59.310 --> 22:02.010
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:02.080 --> 22:06.020
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:07.490 --> 22:10.180
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:10.260 --> 22:12.420
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:12.890 --> 22:16.990
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:18.430 --> 22:21.030
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:21.100 --> 22:23.760
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:23.840 --> 22:27.800
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:29.140 --> 22:31.580
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.650 --> 22:34.580
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.650 --> 22:39.520
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:40.190 --> 22:42.850
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:42.920 --> 22:45.620
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.690 --> 22:50.320
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:51.060 --> 22:53.760
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:53.830 --> 22:56.430
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:56.500 --> 23:01.130
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:01.810 --> 23:06.300
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:07.250 --> 23:12.910
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:15.260 --> 23:17.950
Next time

23:18.130 --> 23:19.220
What's going on?

23:19.290 --> 23:20.950
Why am I back in my room?!

23:21.030 --> 23:23.620
Where's Shinryu? Where has Chibi gone?!

23:23.830 --> 23:25.920
Oh, Daisuke. What are you doing?

23:26.230 --> 23:28.030
What? Preparing for the Cultural Festival?

23:28.100 --> 23:29.400
You want me to help too?

23:29.470 --> 23:32.770
Why, of course, our school is holding
the Cultural Festival soon!

23:32.870 --> 23:35.670
So there you have it, from next week
it'll be a brand new high school drama...

23:35.740 --> 23:37.000
"Dragon High School"!

23:37.080 --> 23:38.370
...who are we kidding?

23:38.680 --> 23:40.650
Next on Dragon Drive, "Shinryu".

23:40.710 --> 23:42.380
What in the world is going on?!

23:42.380 --> 23:42.880
Shinryu
What in the world is going on?!

23:42.880 --> 23:42.920
Shinryu

23:42.920 --> 23:44.450
Shinryu
Unbelievable!

